   There is no verified public binary-download path in this guide.
Build from source as described below.  A repository tag, a CI artifact,
or an executable without its adjacent runtime data is not a substitute
for a supported install payload.

   Do not set ‘OMNIVOX_ENGINE’ during initial setup.  Its empty value
selects the normal platform engine above.  Engine routing and optional
Piper, Eloquence, or DECtalk support are later customizations, not
prerequisites for first speech.


