8.5 Messaging
=============

Emacsvox integrates with several Emacs mail and messaging modes.  The
curated workflow for indexed mail search, asynchronous results, thread
reading, attachments, and privacy controls is *note Notmuch Mail::.  For
another client, start with its own manual and ‘C-h m’; use the generated
reference to find an Emacsvox module with the same package or mode name.


